<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/MaterialOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A material or physical output created or produced as a result of a project or an endeavour such as a research investigation. Examples include a building constructed as a result of a building project, and research outputs such as a cell line, a mouse mutant or a new form of microscope."@en .
